// Request rate per region, from the trading app.
//
// The field shape is the whole lesson of the course in one query:
//   values     -> metrics.http_requests_total     (underscored, _total suffix)
//   dimensions -> labels.region, labels.namespace (Prometheus labels)
// The same signal over OTLP would be metrics.http.server.requests and
// attributes.region. Same app, different field model, because the path differed.
TS ${DATA_STREAM}
| WHERE TRANGE(1 hour)
| STATS rps = SUM(RATE(`metrics.http_requests_total`, 1 minute))
    BY region = `labels.region`, ns = `labels.namespace`, bucket = TBUCKET(1 minute)
| WHERE rps IS NOT NULL
| SORT bucket DESC, region
| LIMIT 60
